    "enUS": {
      "dialogue": {
        "9f3b63afadc7847bcb71": "Hail friend - a moment of your time, if I may...$B$BWe have endured much in our trials and tribulations in establishing Teldrassil.  Were the constant strife of the times not enough, we now find ourselves in a dire shortage of cloth.  If you have the materials to spare, I ask that you please donate them.  You certainly would earn the gratitude of night elves everywhere in helping us out!"
      },
      "name": "Raedon Duskstriker",
      "subName": "Alliance Cloth Quartermaster",
      "translationMetadata": {
        "fields": {
          "dialogue.9f3b63afadc7847bcb71": {
